;; :subject = :agent | :enterprise | :human+agent | :personal
;; 一次基準: §2.1 主体軸 / 判断ルール §2.2 / 境界原則 §2.3 (lib vs deployed-organism)
{:adr "0020-three-org-taxonomy-agent-enterprise-library"
